                                                "example_id": "bb9ebb45-12bb-4ed5-a334-8b5e0f64cad5",
                                                "sense_id": "ff3c3a54-1bb9-36cd-9150-cdf3fcc4f64a",
                                                "text": "The colour-light signals admitting directly to the platforms and the inner starters (for short-length departures well up the platforms) are two-aspect, while those immediately beyond them are three-aspect, but elsewhere four-aspect signals have been installed in association with route indicators."
